# 📊 Sales Analysis Project

## 📁 Dataset

- Superstore.csv

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Google Sheets / Microsoft Excel
  - Data Cleaning
  - Pivot Tables
  - Pivot Charts
  - Basic Formulas (SUM, AVERAGE, IF, VLOOKUP)

## 📌 Objective

Analyze sales and profit data to identify trends, top-performing categories, and actionable business insights.

