---

## 🔍 Key Insights

- Consumer segment generated the highest sales.
- Technology category was the most profitable.
- West region led in total sales and profit.
- South region had the lowest sales among all regions.
- Some sub-categories such as Tables and Bookcases showed losses.

---

## 📈 KPIs Tracked

- Total Sales
- Total Profit
- Average Sales
- Top Performing Region
- Lowest Performing Region

---

## 🎯 Outcome

Converted raw sales data into meaningful insights using data cleaning, pivot tables, and dashboard design techniques to support business decision-making.

